    "custom_reviews_xVgyi3": {
      "type": "custom-reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "review_FFVmHf": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "slide_image": "shopify://shop_images/281024_SteffixMonthlies8345-2_2_86336046-3fb8-4359-8ec2-ef363a558a7b.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "author": "<p>Kyra, 34</p>",
            "text": "<p>Monthlies have been part of my morning routine for 6 weeks now, and wow — what a difference! My migraines have eased up, I’m sleeping better, and I finally feel like I’m in charge of my cycle, not the other way around. Total game-changer. YAY for balance!</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_C78NfW": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "slide_image": "shopify://shop_images/281024_SteffixMonthlies8345-2_2_86336046-3fb8-4359-8ec2-ef363a558a7b.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "author": "<p>Johanna, 29</p>",
            "text": "<p>I have been using Monthlies for over a month and I've had two periods, the first one just a few days after starting. I was really skeptical but I have to say, what a difference it made! I had been having severe cramps for months, so bad I could not even walk. Now I can only feel some discomfort.<br/>It gets four stars simply because I really don't like the taste (though I'm getting used to it). However it seems like there will be a new flavour soon, so can't wait!<br/>I would definitely recommend it to anyone suffering from menstrual cramps.</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_k3mFFt": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "slide_image": "shopify://shop_images/281024_SteffixMonthlies8345-2_2_86336046-3fb8-4359-8ec2-ef363a558a7b.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "author": "<p>Miriam, 41</p>",
            "text": "<p>Originally bought this for my daughter but she didn’t like it. I tried it and loved it. Not sure if I don’t put enough in my class, but lasts me longer than 1 month and now feel like I can’t keep up! Highly recommend though. Hardly any period pain and my skin is glowing</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_E4NJBr": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "slide_image": "shopify://shop_images/281024_SteffixMonthlies8345-2_2_86336046-3fb8-4359-8ec2-ef363a558a7b.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "author": "<p>Susanne, 36</p>",
            "text": "<p>I've been taking Monthlies for two months. Some PMS symptoms, like mood swings and water retention, are better. I also think I felt more energetic during my second month. But I'm still waiting for my cramps to go away or for me to feel less exhausted during my period. I'm hoping the effects will finally kick in with my third period.</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_aXWXw4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "slide_image": "shopify://shop_images/281024_SteffixMonthlies8345-2_2_86336046-3fb8-4359-8ec2-ef363a558a7b.png",
            "stars": 5,
            "author": "<p>Susanne, 36</p>",
            "text": "<p>In den ersten Wochen war ich oft frustriert, weil ich keine sofortigen Ergebnisse sah. Aber ich gab nicht auf und folgte meinem Plan. Nach ein paar Monaten begann ich, echte Fortschritte zu bemerken. Es ist erstaunlich, wie viel sich ändern kann, wenn man an sich selbst glaubt und die richtigen Schritte unternimmt. Ich fühle mich jetzt stärker als je zuvor!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
